# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of the checkout platform's core.autocrlf
# setting. This fixes a recurring Prettier/format:check flake on Windows, where a file re-saved
# with CRLF by a Windows tool (or Git's own autocrlf conversion) fails `npm run format:check`
# even though its committed content (the blob) is LF. See the 10 Sep 2026 uiux-polish-fix pass
# (docs/handoffs/2026-09-09-uiux-polish-fix.md, Task F7) for the incident this fixes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never go through line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
